From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dnsapi: DnsStartMulticastQuery and DnsStopMulticastQuery (6069)

A name's records answered on the local link, through the system's avahi
daemon, reported to the callback until DnsStopMulticastQuery, which
returns once a running callback is done.
---
